 spaces and the vertical arrows are smooth.\nThe following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> for any diagram as above such that in addition\n<MATH_0006> is smooth\nthe morphism <MATH_0007> has property <MATH_0008>, and\n<STRUCT_0004> for some diagram as above with <MATH_0009> surjective\nthe morphism <MATH_0010> has property <MATH_0011>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\nIf <MATH_0012> and <MATH_0013> are representable by algebraic spaces,\nthen this is also equivalent to <MATH_0014> (as a morphism of algebraic spaces)\nhaving property <MATH_0015>. If <MATH_0016> is also preserved under\nany base change, and fppf local on the base, then for morphisms <MATH_0017>\nwhich are representable by algebraic spaces this\nis also equivalent to <MATH_0018> having property <MATH_0019> in the sense\nof\nProperties of Stacks,\nSection <REF_0001>.\n<STRUCT_0006>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:01acdc55192e610ca824e9f704e788e529f66baf029ccdcaa3aaf15bf3910c57", "unit_id": "inventory:stacks-morphisms:06FM:lemma/0001"}}}], "input_freeze": {"hash": "sha256:0a5ff48b50bca12624babcfef79acabaa0fd8d5e16fa4103c131032c6ff3a251", "path": "translation-data/source-adoption-inputs/p0-101-stacks-morphisms-p044.json"}, "model_output": {"hash": "sha256:2b4819a517ee173705847886ced457c146bc5a7d4a0593ce3af4cd631f04dbf3", "path": "docs/evidence/p0-101-stacks-morphisms-p044-raw-01.jsonl", "record_hash": "sha256:11886591d46b3d094d6646f94ab8c2ffcdf148b22fa34a3bcd5b58e27314bd5b"}, "neighbor_unit_ids": [], "policy_revision": "git:7c4e1984fe4e6b4ae37e01477744ca9f9a46294c", "prior_generations": [], "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "source_adoption_id": "p0-101-stacks-morphisms-p044", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "style_guide_path": "config/style-guide.md", "turn_id": "01a20c44-4919-7433-92b6-56fd3b57bacb", "unit_id": "tag:06PW:statement"}, "context_hash": "sha256:cb59d4545244450f4dcdeb7b88c62c8a0a858a6abceade285697e7981c56ff73", "created_at": "2026-11-24T06:35:35.972517+00:00", "glossa